---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CV" description="CV for Astrid Lapinski: role history, a PayPal Credit architecture role, and open-to roles.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-heading">CV</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">My résumé and role history. I'm open to Technical Product Owner and architect roles.</p>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="open-heading">
    <h2 id="open-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Open to</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Technical Product Owner and architect roles.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="history-heading">
    <h2 id="history-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Role history</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc list-outside ml-5 space-y-2 text-ink-soft">
      <li>Independent Contractor and Software Engineer, Rainbowfern (2023 to present)</li>
      <li>Principal Technical Staff, Software Architecture for Credit Platform, PayPal (2019 to 2023)</li>
      <li>Senior Engineer in Business Financing, PayPal (2017 to 2019)</li>
      <li>Principal Developer, Razorfish Healthware (2012 to 2014)</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Full history and detail: the <a href="/experience" class="text-accent hover:underline inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">experience page</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
    <h2 id="education-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Education</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Drexel University: M.S. Software Engineering (2017) and B.S. Computer Science (2008). Also: the <a href="/education" class="text-accent hover:underline inline-flex min-h-11 items-center">education page</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="download-heading">
    <h2 id="download-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Download</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">[TBD: résumé PDF]</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
